    "buggy_baseline_is_parent": true,
    "single_parent_matches_baseline": true,
    "commit_message": "Handle unconditionally deprecated nodes as deprecated\n\nThis happens e.g. with\n\n```swift\n// Historical names\n@available(*, deprecated, renamed: \"Sendable\")\n@available(swift, obsoleted: 6.0, renamed: \"Sendable\")\npublic typealias ConcurrentValue = Sendable\n```\n\nWhich were missing the deprecated marker without this fix.\n\nInstead of just getting the deprecated string value, we also need to\ncheck if it was unconditionally deprecated.\n\nresolves https://github.com/swiftlang/swift-docc/issues/1586",
    "boundary_evidence": "repair/boundary-verification.json",
